<view class="studio-page">
  <view class="studio-hero">
    <text class="eyebrow">师生共创</text>
    <text class="title">创意编创台</text>
    <text class="summary">选择动作单元后，按你的顺序生成可播放的动作片段预览。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="demo-notice">
    <text>素材已从你提供的 MP4 裁剪成动作帧；当前输出为连续播放的组合片段预览。已保存 {{savedCount}} 个作品。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="section-head">
    <text class="section-title">微律动单元</text>
    <text class="count">{{units.length}} 个素材</text>
  </view>

  <view class="unit-grid">
    <view
      class="unit-card {{item.color}}"
      wx:for="{{units}}"
      wx:key="id"
      bindtap="addUnit"
      data-id="{{item.id}}"
    >
      <text class="unit-name">{{item.name}}</text>
      <text class="unit-meta">{{item.tempo}} · {{item.mood}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="sequence-panel">
    <view class="section-head compact">
      <text class="section-title">作品序列</text>
      <text class="count">{{selectedUnits.length}} 段</text>
    </view>

    <view class="empty" wx:if="{{selectedUnits.length === 0}}">
      <text>尚未选择动作单元</text>
    </view>

    <scroll-view class="sequence-scroll" scroll-x wx:else>
      <view class="sequence-item" wx:for="{{selectedUnits}}" wx:key="key">
        <text class="sequence-index">{{index + 1}}</text>
        <text class="sequence-name">{{item.name}}</text>
      </view>
    </scroll-view>

    <view class="piece-name" wx:if="{{pieceName}}">
      <text>{{pieceName}}</text>
    </view>

    <view class="actions">
      <button class="ghost-btn" bindtap="clearPiece">清空</button>
      <button class="preview-btn" bindtap="generateVideo">生成片段</button>
      <button class="save-btn" bindtap="savePiece">保存作品</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="output-panel" wx:if="{{outputReady}}">
    <view class="section-head compact">
      <text class="section-title">视频输出</text>
      <text class="count">{{currentClipIndex + 1}} / {{selectedUnits.length}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="frame-player">
      <image class="output-frame" src="{{previewFrameUrl}}" mode="aspectFit"></image>
      <view class="play-badge" wx:if="{{isPlayingSequence}}">
        <text>播放中</text>
      </view>
      <button class="replay-btn" bindtap="replayVideo">重播</button>
    </view>
    <view class="output-meta">
      <text class="output-title">{{pieceName}}</text>
      <text class="output-desc">当前动作：{{previewUnitName}}。当前帧 {{currentFrameIndex + 1}} / 12，播放结束后会自动进入下一个动作。</text>
      <text class="output-error" wx:if="{{videoError}}">{{videoError}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
